id: pm-vcs-p7annotate
title: Annotate text lines and structured fields with native change provenance
description: "Add pm vcs annotate <path> using Phase 6 stable file identities and PM attribution. Attribute per line for text and per FIELD for records, including across renames and rewrites."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-18T03:01:43.507Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-18T21:47:27.563Z"
author: codex-agent
estimated_minutes: 600
acceptance_criteria: "TOON and JSON name change id, author, agent harness/model provenance and linked pm item for every line or field; rename/copy and rewritten histories retain correct attribution; unresolved units report their multiple origins."
parent: pm-vcs-phase7
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-vcs-p7objects,blocked_by,"2026-10-18T03:01:52.890Z",codex-agent,"cli:update:dep",detected
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T18:31:35.748Z",codex-agent,"Plan: add immutable text-line and structured field/list-entry annotation using stable FileIds, following renames and copy ancestry. Walk only parents of the selected revision; cache immutable metadata/payloads and stop once requested units have origins. Read PM harness/model provenance from the owning change snapshot history where recorded; retain explicit commit item links and native item identity. Group adjacent text rows by origin by default, expose --full and --at, and report unresolved side origins. Instrument actual object reads on a 2000-change synthetic history. PR 1 is pushed as #125 with CI running; this branch starts independently from main."
  "2026-10-18T18:44:53.512Z",codex-agent,"Focused annotation acceptance passed 17/17 and measured engine/annotate.ts at 100% statements/branches/functions/lines with no ignores or threshold changes. This includes real native PM event capture with synthetic model provenance, packed TOON/JSON, stable change selectors, text/list/scalar attribution, rename/copy/rewrites, repeated contenders, absence, shallow boundaries and 2000-change object-read assertions. Additional cache/copy controls passed 2/2; the linked complete 18-test rerun is in progress. Behavioral reverts in an isolated source copy: remove only unchanged-unit parent matching -> node --test --test-name-pattern=\"^text annotation follows\" test/annotate.test.ts fails 0/1; remove only stable-identity fallback from locate -> node --test --test-name-pattern=\"^stable file identities\" test/annotate.test.ts fails 0/1 (rename incorrectly attributed to the move). Production TypeScript is imported directly; no dist rebuild is needed. Source is restored. Full isolated npm/Bun release checks and CI follow; no item closure or release approval is claimed."
  "2026-10-18T19:03:16.753Z",codex-agent,"First CI coverage run passed the full functional suite and all 67 production files except the new annotate handler default-options branch: vcs-commands.ts:512 was 99.71% branches, while engine/annotate.ts and engine/repo.ts were both 100% in all dimensions. Added a real harness call without --at/--full, asserting current HEAD attribution; the targeted command test passes. Updated command-registration inventory to 42 and removed stale architecture wording that still called annotation planned. Interrupted local old-source release runs are excluded from acceptance; both full gates restart after this test/documentation commit. No runtime code, thresholds, dependency pins or workflows change."
  "2026-10-18T20:05:06.792Z",codex-agent,"Expanded read-boundary/copy controls exposed two alternative-origin gaps: a conflicted file born after 2000 unrelated commits read 4007 objects, and a recorded copy of a copy lost earlier side origins. The query now prunes a parent without the identity and carries each located file identity/path into the next parent, including copy ancestry. The same instrumented late-birth case stays within 10 reads and opens no older ancestor; the original full-path history remains bounded at 4001 reads. Copy sources are deliberately unambiguous so Phase 6 records each copiedFrom edge. A proposal-only alternative still exhausts and deduplicates the existing identity ancestry, reporting unavailable rather than inventing authors. Expanded full annotation suite: 18/18 pass, zero failures/skips/cancellations, engine/annotate.ts remains 100% statements/branches/functions/lines. Both new regressions failed against the previous alternative method. Earlier interrupted local gate runs are excluded; both complete gates restart after this source commit."
  "2026-10-18T21:47:13.007Z",codex-agent,"Final source acceptance on 339baad801e19705cd89dc428442027af3483afe: unchanged npm run release:check AND bun run release:check pass with fresh HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 in independent full-history checkouts. Each coverage suite passes 1630/1630, zero failures, skipped, cancelled or TODO. c8 --all --100 --per-file measures all 67 production files at 100% statements, branches, functions and lines: 23249/23249 statements and lines, 7169/7169 branches and 792/792 functions. ESLint has zero warnings; jscpd has zero clone pairs and 0% duplication; docstrings cover 67 files and 362 declarations. Native TOON, stat-cache, committed self-host, production/identity audits, pack, changelog and release-attestation checks pass. Source CI passes Node 22/26, Windows launchers and CodeQL. Linked pm test pm-vcs-p7annotate --run --progress passes all 18 tests. The 2000-change counter asserts each ancestry object is read once, at most 4001 objects, no unrelated payloads or ref histories; a conflicted file born at the tip stays within 10 reads rather than 4007. Two-generation copies retain all recorded side origins."
  "2026-10-18T21:47:17.050Z",codex-agent,"Final-source behavioural revert receipts, isolated source copies importing production TypeScript: remove only unchanged-unit parent matching, then node --test --test-name-pattern=\"^text annotation follows\" test/annotate.test.ts fails 0/1; remove only stable-identity fallback from locate, then node --test --test-name-pattern=\"^stable file identities\" test/annotate.test.ts fails 0/1. Restore only the previous alternative-origin method, then node --test --test-name-pattern=\"^2000-change history\" test/annotate.test.ts fails 0/1 (4007 reads exceeds 10), and node --test --test-name-pattern=\"^copied disputes\" test/annotate.test.ts fails 0/1 (copy-chain side origins lost). All four controls have one assertion failure, zero passes, skips or cancellations. Restored annotation acceptance is 18/18 through the linked runner."
  "2026-10-18T21:47:21.791Z",codex-agent,"Handoff: text lines group by owning change by default; --full expands them, structured scalar/list units retain per-unit attribution, and --at accepts immutable revisions or unique stable change IDs. Authors, linked PM items and recorded harness/model provenance come from immutable snapshots, with explicit unavailable ancestry. This PR branches independently from main; after resolve PR #125 merges, refresh shared documentation and regenerate the self-host bundle. Signing and bisect remain separate items. Release workflows and dependency pins are unchanged; publishing stays disabled pending owner approval. No new pm CLI/SDK defect was encountered. Existing linked-test result tracking is disabled, so comments retain receipts. The item remains in_progress and is not closed; claim is released for review. Receipt-only changes regenerate the self-host bundle after explicit staging; final-head CI and strict health from a new clone will be checked before handoff."
